FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Où tu vas comme ça, avec ta pelle ?{{TAG:0008:0000:1400000015000000}}
Là bas.
Euh... Nulle part.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dove vai di bello con quella pala?{{TAG:0008:0000:1400000015000000}}
Vado laggiù.
Mmh... In nessun posto!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}O kürekle nereye gidiyorsun?{{TAG:0008:0000:1400000015000000}}
Şuraya kadar.
Şey... hiçbir yere!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, tu en as, de la chance,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}} ! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Moi aussi, j'aimerais
avoir un aussi joli parapluie !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Does that party popper mean
there's a celebration going on?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
You seem very festive today!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}O parti patlatıcısı bir kutlama
olduğu anlamına mı geliyor?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bugün çok şen görünüyorsun!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oooh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} You have bubbles!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Watching bubbles ride the breeze{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
makes me feel like I could float
away with happiness too!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, wie lustig, du hast ein Windrad!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Puh, aber mir wird's ganz anders,
wenn ich es zu lange ansehe...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I often spill my coffee when I'm
walking around with it.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Coffee stains are hard to get out,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
so be careful with your drink!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Quando un pesce abbocca,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}io vado in panico: tiro la lenza
troppo presto{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}e loro se la svignano!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Wenn bei mir ein Fisch anbeißt, dann
ziehe ich die Angel zu schnell ein{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
und{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} – schwupp! – {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}ist er wieder weg.

TRANSLATION:
Bazen oltama balık takılınca{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
heyecanlanıp çok erken
çekiyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}ve kaçıyorlar.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sembri molto brav{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} a pescare!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Devi darmi assolutamente
qualche buon consiglio!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Du bist bestimmt gut im Angeln.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Vielleicht kannst du's mir ja auch
mal beibringen...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Fireworks are fun any time of year.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I don't want to wait for summer to
enjoy them!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Il n'y a pas de saison pour s'amuser.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}C'est la barbe de devoir attendre
l'été pour voir des feux d'artifice !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I fuochi d'artificio {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}sono splendidi
in qualsiasi momento dell'anno.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Non voglio aspettare fino all'estate!
